<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Home Additions</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">The right addition changes everything.</h2>
        <p class="section-body-wide" style="margin-bottom:20px;">Moving is expensive, stressful, and often unnecessary when a thoughtfully designed addition can give you exactly what you need — right in the home and neighborhood you already love. Our Design-Build process ensures the addition integrates with your existing structure architecturally, structurally, and aesthetically.</p>
        <p class="section-body-wide" style="margin-bottom:32px;">We handle everything: the design and engineering, zoning and variance navigation, permitting, structural work, mechanical coordination, and all interior and exterior finish work. One contract. One team. Zero handoffs.</p>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:12px 20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);border:1px solid var(--color-border);display:inline-block;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-body-subtle);">Typical Range</div>
          <div style="font-family:monospace;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-body);">$80K–$400K+</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div><div style="height:380px;border-radius:var(--r-2xl);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card-hover);" class="img-fullhome"></div></div>
