<section class="section-pad" style="background:white;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center"><div class="section-eyebrow">Types of Additions</div><h2 class="section-title">Whatever space you need, we can build it.</h2></div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="gap:24px;">
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🏠</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Room Additions</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Attached room additions that expand your living room, master suite, or family room — blending seamlessly with your existing roofline and architecture.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">↔️</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Bump-Outs</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Smaller, cost-effective extensions (4–10 feet) that dramatically expand a kitchen, bathroom, or bedroom without the cost of a full addition.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">👨‍👩‍👧</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">In-Law Suites</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Fully self-contained in-law apartments and accessory dwelling units — private entrance, kitchenette, bedroom, and bath, designed for independence and dignity.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">⬆️</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Second-Floor Additions</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Complete second-floor additions over a first-floor footprint — bedrooms, baths, and living space added above without expanding your lot coverage.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🌞</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Sunrooms &amp; Four-Season Rooms</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Glass-and-frame sunroom additions with radiant floor heating, Andersen windows, and insulated ceilings — usable year-round on the North Shore.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🚗</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Garage Conversions</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Converting attached garages into finished living space — offices, studios, gyms, or family rooms — with proper insulation and systems integration.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container"><div class="container-sm" style="margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="section-header-center"><div class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</div><h2 class="section-title">How a WORKS addition gets built.</h2></div>
    <ul class="includes-list">
      <li class="include-item"><div class="include-check">1</div><div><strong>Feasibility &amp; Zoning Review</strong> — we assess setbacks, lot coverage limits, and zoning rules before you commit to anything</div></li>
      <li class="include-item"><div class="include-check">2</div><div><strong>Architectural Design</strong> — our in-house designers develop full plans that integrate with your existing home architecturally and structurally</div></li>
      <li class="include-item"><div class="include-check">3</div><div><strong>Engineering &amp; Permitting</strong> — structural engineering, permit applications, and coordination with the building department managed entirely by our team</div></li>
      <li class="include-item"><div class="include-check">4</div><div><strong>Construction</strong> — foundation, framing, roofing, exterior cladding, all mechanicals, and complete interior finish work</div></li>
      <li class="include-item"><div class="include-check">5</div><div><strong>Final Inspection &amp; Delivery</strong> — we manage the certificate of occupancy process and final walkthrough — you don't lift a finger</div></li>
    </ul>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
